## 3. DNS response resolving to internal IP (10.0.19.9)

The suspicious domain resolved to an internal address (**10.0.19.9**) instead of an external IP.  
This is abnormal and indicates internal redirection or sandbox behavior.

**Screenshot:**  
![Internal IP Response](screenshots/internal-ip.png)

