## 5. SMB, LDAP, and DCERPC communication with the same internal host

After contacting the suspicious domain, the workstation communicated with **10.0.19.9** using SMB, LDAP, and DCERPC.  
This behavior is consistent with post-exploitation or lateral movement attempts.

**Screenshot:**  
![SMB & Internal Traffic](screenshots/smb.png)

